---
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="inicio" class="relative isolate bg-gradient-to-b from-vidalia-ivory to-white">
  <!-- Portada: la fachada de fondo bajo un velo azul parejo para que el texto se lea. -->
  <div class="relative isolate overflow-hidden">
    <img
      src="/img/fachada-vidalia.webp"
      alt=""
      width="1200"
      height="800"
      fetchpriority="high"
      data-hero-bg
      class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-20 h-[115%] w-full object-cover object-[60%_center] lg:object-center"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-vidalia-deep/65" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-20 pb-40 sm:pt-28 sm:pb-48 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-56">
      <header data-reveal-stagger class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center text-white">
        <h1 data-split class="text-4xl leading-[1.15] tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.4rem]">
          <span class="block font-bold">Funeraria en Colima:</span>
          <span class="block font-normal">atención inmediata 24/7 y previsión funeraria</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85">
          Somos un lugar cálido, precio claro y un acompañamiento que no termina con la despedida.
        </p>
      </header>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto -mt-28 max-w-7xl px-4 pb-16 sm:-mt-36 lg:-mt-40 lg:pb-24">
    <!-- Dos caminos: urgencia (hoy) y previsión (para dejarlo resuelto). -->
    <div data-reveal-stagger class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <article data-spotlight class="relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-vidalia-gold/40 bg-white p-8 text-vidalia-blue shadow-soft sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight font-bold sm:text-4xl">Servicio Funerario</h2>
        <span data-filete class="mt-4 block h-0.5 w-20 origin-left rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-vidalia-gold to-vidalia-gold/20" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-vidalia-blue/85">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="ph-fill ph-clock text-lg text-vidalia-gold" aria-hidden="true"></i> Disponibles 24/7</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="ph-fill ph-lightning text-lg text-vidalia-gold" aria-hidden="true"></i> Atención Inmediata</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="ph-fill ph-flower-lotus text-lg text-vidalia-gold" aria-hidden="true"></i> Velación y Cremación</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="ph-fill ph-files text-lg text-vidalia-gold" aria-hidden="true"></i> Te apoyamos con los trámites</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-auto grid gap-3 pt-8 sm:grid-cols-[1.45fr_1fr]">
          <a href={SITE.phoneHref} class="btn bg-vidalia-gold whitespace-nowrap text-white hover:bg-vidalia-blue">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-phone-call" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Llamar Ahora · {SITE.phone}
          </a>
          <a href={SITE.inmediatoHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn border border-vidalia-gold bg-white text-vidalia-blue hover:bg-vidalia-gold hover:text-white">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-whatsapp-logo" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article data-spotlight class="relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-vidalia-gold/40 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight font-bold text-vidalia-blue sm:text-4xl">Previsión Funeraria</h2>
        <span data-filete class="mt-4 block h-0.5 w-20 origin-left rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-vidalia-gold to-vidalia-gold/20" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-2 text-vidalia-blue">
          <span class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">$238</span>
          <span class="text-lg font-semibold">a la quincena</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-vidalia-blue/75">
          Paquete Vidalia · 4 años · sin intereses ni comisiones · precio congelado mientras vayas al corriente.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto grid gap-3 pt-8 sm:grid-cols-[1.45fr_1fr]">
          <a href={SITE.contratarHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn bg-vidalia-blue text-white hover:bg-vidalia-deep">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-file-text" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Contratar en línea
          </a>
          <a href={SITE.whatsappHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn border border-vidalia-gold bg-white text-vidalia-blue hover:bg-vidalia-gold hover:text-white">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-whatsapp-logo" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
